{
  "summary": "H.B. No. 2067 amends Texas Insurance Code Chapter 551 provisions governing declination, cancellation, and nonrenewal of insurance policies. It requires insurers to provide written reasons and, for liability and commercial property insurance applications, written notice of declination; the Act applies prospectively and takes effect September 1, 2025.",
